# Vulnerabilities Trivy reports in the image that the build accepts, each with why. The Trivy step in
# .github/workflows/gradle.yml fails on any other fixable high or critical one.

# spring-webmvc 6.2: fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4, #383). Both are in
# features the app doesn't use. CVE-2026-47884 needs an XsltView, and nothing configures one or an
# XSLT view resolver. CVE-2026-47890 is in server-sent events rendered through views, and nothing
# returns an SseEmitter, a ResponseBodyEmitter or a ServerSentEvent.
CVE-2026-47884
CVE-2026-47890
